          %h3#InfiniteTemperatureThermalFieldTheory Infinite-temperature thermal field theory
          %p
            With the formulation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/thermal+field+theory"} thermal field theory
            via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wick+rotation"} Wick rotation
            as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Euclidean+field+theory"} Euclidean field theory
            on a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riemannian+manifold"} Riemannian manifold
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi X
                    %mn 3
                  %mo ×
                  %msubsup
                    %mi S
                    %mi β
                    %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X_3 \times S^1_\beta
            whose compact/periodic Euclidean time runs along a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/circle"} circle
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msubsup
                    %mi S
                    %mi β
                    %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^1_\beta
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/length"} circumference
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi β
                    %mo =
                    %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                    %mi T
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \beta = 1/T
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/limit+of+a+sequence"} limit
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi β
                  %mo →
                  %mn 0
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \beta \to 0
            in which this
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/circle"} circle
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber"} fiber
            shrinks away.
          %p
            In terms of the thermal
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Euclidean+field+theory"} Euclidean field theory
            on
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi X
                    %mn 3
                  %mo ×
                  %msubsup
                    %mi S
                    %mi β
                    %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X_3 \times S^1_\beta
            therefore the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinite-temperature+thermal+field+theory"} infinite-temperature limit
            is given by Kaluaza-Klein-type dimensional reduction along this circle
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber"} fiber
            to a 3-dimensional
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Euclidean+field+theory"} Euclidean field theory
            on
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi X
                    %mn 3
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X_3
            (
            %a{:href => "#Ginsparg80"}> Ginsparg 80
            ,
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#AppelquistPisarski81"} Appelquist-Pisarski 81
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#Nadkarni83"} Nadkarni 83
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#Jourjine84"} Jourjine 84
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#Nadkarni88"} Nadkarni 88
          %p
            As usual with
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-reduction"} KK-reduction
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+field+theory"} local field theory
            = succeed ")," do
              %a{:href => "#Landsman89"} Landsman 89
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#Reisz92"} Reisz 92
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#KajantieLaineRummukainenShaposhnikov96"} Kajantie-Laine-Rummukainen-Shaposhnikov 96
