          %h3#ReferencesInWickrotatedThermalFieldTheory In Wick-rotated thermal field theory
          %p
            Discussion of Kaluza-Klein-style dimensional reduction in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wick+rotation"} Wick rotated
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/thermal+field+theory"} thermal field theory
            on a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/circle"} circle
            of compact/periodic Euclidean time
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msubsup
                    %mi S
                    %mi β
                    %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^1_\beta
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/length"} circumference
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi β
                  %mo =
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                  %mi T
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \beta = 1/T
            (see at
            = succeed "):" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinite-temperature+thermal+field+theory"} infinite-temperature thermal field theory
          %ul
            %li#Ginsparg80
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Ginsparg"}> Paul Ginsparg
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em First and second order phase transitions in gauge theories at finite temperature
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(80)90418-6"} doi:10.1016/0550-3213(80)90418-6
            %li#AppelquistPisarski81
