                  %em Solution to the Perturbative Infrared Catastrophe of Hot Gauge Theories
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.74.2164"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.74.2164
            %li#KajantieLaineRummukainenShaposhnikov96
