                K. Kajantie, M. Laine, K. Rummukainen, M. Shaposhnikov,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Generic rules for high temperature dimensional reduction and their application to the standard model
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(95)00549-8"} doi:10.1016/0550-3213(95)00549-8
          %p
            and specifically with an eye to discussion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quark-gluon+plasma"} quark-gluon plasma
            in
          %ul
